  "_beats": [
    "HOOK face: 'Bayangin' typed (left), '3 pencarian' stacked with a huge 3 slamming in, then camera pulls back and three blank search bars pop above the head (kit bars in face slots)",
    "ORB -> crowd scene: everyone gets a blank bar above the head on 'Semua orang'; 'kamu' slides in; 'orang di depanmu' steps forward while the crowd dims, their bar types the spoken search",
    "BARS -> face: 'temanmu' chip on the chest, a bar above the head types the second spoken search",
    "ORB -> pair scene: kamu + orang yang kamu suka, a heart pops between them, the bar above the other person types the third search",
    "BARS -> face: 'lucu kan?' slides in from the right + 'pikir lagi'; eyes appear left and right of the head on 'melihat', a magnifier above, 'diam-diam' typed",
    "ORB -> cards slide in one per spoken item (Ketakutanmu / Rasa penasaranmu / Pertanyaan), a lock slams on 'siapapun'",
    "PUSH -> hanging price tag 'Privacy' drops and swings, 'paling mahal' stamp slams on, coins and money drop",
    "BARS -> face ending: the three bars return above the head (callback), 'berani?' + 'keluar rumah?', music hit on the last word"
  ]
